<Behavior #flow-dsl-tree-spec apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" version="1" (
  <Requirements [
    <Requirement #bundle-loading (
      <Statement ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZA>
      校验器 SHALL 用 xnl-core（≥0.1.8）加载流定义 bundle，等价支持多文件形态（manifest.xnl + 按文件根 tag 发现的域文件，无 domains 声明）与单文件形态（域内联为 () 区段），并把 parser 的 DUPLICATE_CHILD 等警告视为违规。
      </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZA>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "bundle-loading" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case { name = "多文件加载" } (
              <Given ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZB>
              order-fulfillment bundle（manifest + 6 个域文件）
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZB>
              <When ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZC>
              运行校验器
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZC>
              <Then ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZD>
              成功加载，容器形态识别为 WorkCtrlFlow
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZD>
            )>
            <Case { name = "单文件加载" } (
              <Given ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZE>
              instant-http-check 单文件 bundle
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZE>
              <When ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZF>
              运行校验器
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZF>
              <Then ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZG>
              成功加载，内联区段视同域文件
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZG>
            )>
            <Case { name = "域文件缺失" } (
              <Given ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZH>
              bundle 目录缺少必需的 tree 域文件
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZH>
              <When ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZJ>
              运行校验器
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZJ>
              <Then ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZK>
              报 missing-tree 违规
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZK>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #core-rules (
      <Statement ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZM>
      校验器 SHALL 实施 flow-core 规则：容器根 tag 合法且 #id 为 FQN；apiVersion/version 必须在元数据位；Tree 子节点在 [] 且恰一个根；树内 #id 唯一；节点 tag 属白名单（控制/核心动作/产品扩展）或已注册的点分动作；config:// 引用（含 sub-path）可解析；config 扁平视图无 key 冲突；expr 引用的 config.* 键存在；vfs://./ 引用的文件存在。
      </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZM>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "core-rules" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case { name = "正例全绿" } (
              <Given ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZN>
              examples/xnl-bundles 三个演示 bundle
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZN>
              <When ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZP>
              运行校验器
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZP>
              <Then ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZQ>
              0 违规，退出码 0
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZQ>
            )>
            <Case { name = "未注册点分动作" } (
              <Given ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZR>
              树含 demo.Missing 但 action.types 未注册
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZR>
              <When ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZS>
              运行校验器
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZS>
              <Then ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZT>
              报 unregistered-action 违规，退出码非 0
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZT>
            )>
            <Case { name = "config 引用悬空" } (
              <Given ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZV>
              节点引用 config://#nope/url
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZV>
              <When ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZW>
              运行校验器
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZW>
              <Then ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZX>
              报 unresolved-config-ref 违规
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZX>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #form-rules (
      <Statement ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZY>
      校验器 SHALL 实施产品形态规则：InstantCtrlFlow 树中出现 ExternalJob/Timer/TaskStep 或声明 state/task.space 域为违规；WorkCtrlFlow 的 state.seed 字段必须在 state.def 声明（非 ? 字段必须有 seed 值）；BPCtrlFlow 的每个 TaskStep 不得带 assignTo、task 引用必须解析到 TaskSpace 直接子节点、一任务至多一个 TaskStep。
      </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZY>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "form-rules" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case { name = "InstantCtrlFlow 含可中断节点" } (
              <Given ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZZ>
              InstantCtrlFlow 树内含 ExternalJob
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKYZZ>
              <When ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKZ00>
              运行校验器
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKZ00>
              <Then ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKZ01>
              报 interruptible-in-instant-ctrl-flow 违规
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKZ01>
            )>
            <Case { name = "seed 未声明字段" } (
              <Given ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKZ02>
              state.seed 含 state.def 未声明的字段
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKZ02>
              <When ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKZ03>
              运行校验器
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKZ03>
              <Then ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKZ04>
              报 seed-undeclared-field 违规
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKZ04>
            )>
            <Case { name = "TaskStep 任务引用悬空" } (
              <Given ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKZ05>
              TaskStep task 指向 task.space 不存在的 id
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKZ05>
              <When ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKZ06>
              运行校验器
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKZ06>
              <Then ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKZ07>
              报 unresolved-task-ref 违规
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKZ07>
            )>
            <Case { name = "TaskStep 引用非直接子节点" } (
              <Given ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKZ08>
              TaskStep task 指向 TaskSpace 深层嵌套的任务
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKZ08>
              <When ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKZ09>
              运行校验器
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKZ09>
              <Then ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKZ0A>
              报 task-ref-not-direct-child 违规
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKZ0A>
            )>
            <Case { name = "TaskStep 带 assignTo" } (
              <Given ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKZ0B>
              TaskStep 节点写了 assignTo
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKZ0B>
              <When ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKZ0C>
              运行校验器
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKZ0C>
              <Then ?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKZ0D>
              报 taskstep-assignto-forbidden 违规
              </?01M0NJZ4MCM079TG6VKRDBKZ0D>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
  ]>
)>
